* errors.def
* Intentionally broken definition used to verify error detection.

DATA-SECTION
    FILE errors.dat LRECL=20 LEND=CRLF

* Duplicate record name
RECORD DUP
    AFIELD LEN=10
    FORMAT=XXXXXXXXXX.
    AFIELD LEN=10
    FORMAT=XXXXXXXXXX.

RECORD DUP
    X LEN=5
    FORMAT=XXXXX.

SCREEN-SECTION
SCREEN BAD-SCREEN COLOR=WhiteOnBlue
    * INTO references a non-existent record
    FIELD "Test" ROW=1 COL=1 LEN=5 INTO NORECORD.NOFIELD
